BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Marxist Reading Group: The ABCs of Communism
DTSTART:20261104T230000Z
DTEND:20261105T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20261109T014705Z
UID:00fd259f58d59dcc7bfc@philly-events
CATEGORIES:dsa
DESCRIPTION:<h5><strong>More Info and RSVP:</strong></h5>\n    <p><a href=
 "https://actionnetwork.org/events/marxist-reading-group-the-abcs-of-commun
 ism">https://actionnetwork.org/events/marxist-reading-group-the-abcs-of-co
 mmunism</a></p>\n    \n    <h5><strong>Description:</strong></h5>\n    <p>
 On Wednesday\, November 4th the Marxist Reading Group will be having our t
 hird session to discuss chapters 4 and 5 of The ABC of Communism by Nikola
 i Bukharin and Evgenii Preobrazhensky\, the canonical textbook of communis
 t theory for socialists across the globe in the 1920’s.<br>Attendees are
  encouraged to have read the chapters beforehand and should note that this
  is intended to be a more advanced theoretical discussion than Socialism 1
 01 or Night School\, which are more introductory.<br>Participants are not 
 required to have been present at the previous sessions\, everyone is welco
 me!<br>We will be meeting at 924 Cherry St\, on the 5th floor at 6pm. The 
 full text can be found at:<br><a href="https://www.marxists.o\nSource: Phi
 lly DSA\nhttps://www.phillydsa.org/events
LOCATION:People's Headquarters\, 924 Cherry Street\, PHILADELPHIA\, PA 191
 07
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.phillydsa.org/events
END:VEVENT
