BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Northwest Philly Candidate Meet-and-Greet Happy Hour
DTSTART:20261106T220000Z
DTEND:20261107T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20261109T014705Z
UID:5d8e7ff33e37e63c3378@philly-events
CATEGORIES:dsa
DESCRIPTION:<h5><strong>More Info and RSVP:</strong></h5>\n    <p><a href=
 "https://actionnetwork.org/events/northwest-philly-candidate-meet-and-gree
 t-happy-hour">https://actionnetwork.org/events/northwest-philly-candidate-
 meet-and-greet-happy-hour</a></p>\n    \n    <h5><strong>Description:</str
 ong></h5>\n    <p>Following up on our MASSIVE victory in Philly earlier th
 is year in securing Rep. Chris Rabb as a Democratic Socialist Congressman-
 elect\, we are turning our sight towards electing socialist candidates in 
 City Hall. As the chapter moves through the endorsement process for City C
 ouncil candidates for 2027\, we are moving towards building our muscle in 
 Northwest Philly where we learned from the Rabb race that socialism is ind
 eed welcome there.</p><div><br>If you live in East Falls\, Roxborough\, Ma
 nayunk\, Germantown\, Mt Airy\, Chestnut Hill\, Nicetown\, Oak Lane\, or a
 nywhere in Philly or the suburbs really\, you are cordially welcome to a <
 strong>DSA and Friends Happy Hour on Friday Nov 6\, 5-7 pm\, at Att\nSourc
 e: Philly DSA\nhttps://www.phillydsa.org/events
LOCATION:Attic Brewing\, 137 Berkley St\, Philadelphia\, PA 19144
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.phillydsa.org/events
END:VEVENT
