BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Philly DSA New Member 101
DTSTART:20261108T160000Z
DTEND:20261108T173000Z
DTSTAMP:20261109T014705Z
UID:6bf2f6d41086e51e132b@philly-events
CATEGORIES:dsa
DESCRIPTION:<h5><strong>More Info and RSVP:</strong></h5>\n    <p><a href=
 "https://actionnetwork.org/events/new-member-101-13">https://actionnetwork
 .org/events/new-member-101-13</a></p>\n    \n    <h5><strong>Description:<
 /strong></h5>\n    <p>This Zoom call is for new members AND anyone thinkin
 g about joining DSA! Come learn what DSA is\, how Philly DSA works\, and t
 he many ways you can get involved!<br>Across the country\, more people are
  turning to democratic socialism because we’re calling for a more democr
 atic society\, and we’re organizing to build it together. Now’s the ti
 me to join DSA\, with more than 2\,500 dues-paying members in Philly! <br>
 Come learn about democratic socialism and our campaigns to build multiraci
 al working class power in Philadelphia... we need you with us to build a b
 etter world!</p>\nSource: Philly DSA\nhttps://www.phillydsa.org/events
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.phillydsa.org/events
END:VEVENT
