BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Philly DSA Building Trades Meeting
DTSTART:20261109T230000Z
DTEND:20261110T003000Z
DTSTAMP:20261109T014705Z
UID:e05e4269ba5084cee0bd@philly-events
CATEGORIES:dsa
DESCRIPTION:<h5><strong>More Info and RSVP:</strong></h5>\n    <p><a href=
 "https://actionnetwork.org/events/philly-dsa-building-trades-meeting">http
 s://actionnetwork.org/events/philly-dsa-building-trades-meeting</a></p>\n 
    \n    <h5><strong>Description:</strong></h5>\n    <p>Do you work in Phi
 ladelphia’s building trades? Are you a socialist\, or just someone who t
 hinks the system isn’t working for us? Join us November 9th starting at 
 6 PM at the Pub on Passyunk East\, for an open-ended discussion on the rel
 ationship between our politics and our work. We will review recent unions'
  contract battles and the landscape of orgnanization within the trades gen
 erally. What is necessary for us to fight back and demand more\, and how d
 o we get there?</p><div><p>This event is organized by the Labor Committee 
 of the Philadelphia Democratic Socialists of America\, but any curious bui
 lding trades workers are welcome to attend!</p></div><div></div><div><div>
 <div><div><div><div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\nSource: Philly D
 SA\nhttps://www.phillydsa.org/events
LOCATION:The Pub on Passyunk East\, 1501 Passyunk Ave\, Philadelphia\, PA 
 19147
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.phillydsa.org/events
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cinema with Comrades Happy Hour + Movie Meetup
DTSTART:20261109T233000Z
DTEND:20261110T023000Z
DTSTAMP:20261109T014705Z
UID:f3ca97406c35b8dad66c@philly-events
CATEGORIES:dsa
DESCRIPTION:<h5><strong>More Info and RSVP:</strong></h5>\n    <p><a href=
 "https://actionnetwork.org/events/cinema-with-comrades-happy-hour-movie-me
 etup-7">https://actionnetwork.org/events/cinema-with-comrades-happy-hour-m
 ovie-meetup-7</a></p>\n    \n    <h5><strong>Description:</strong></h5>\n 
    <p>Are you a new DSA member looking to get started? Are you an experien
 ced organizer who recently moved to Philly? Do you want to meet some local
  comrades and enjoy a great movie?</p><p>Join us for Cinema with Comrades 
 meetup + Happy Hour to chat with new friends!</p><p>Casual\, small-group g
 athering to see a movie\, get to know each other\, grab drinks\, and explo
 re how you can get involved in DSA. All are welcome\, even if you’re not
  a member yet!</p><p><strong>6:30pm </strong>Wild Horse Nine (<a href="htt
 ps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kqxuamKxRTo">Watch Trailer</a>) at <a href="h
