 tps://actionnetwork.org/events/philly-dsa-healthcare-workers-meetup</a></p
 >\n    \n    <h5><strong>Description:</strong></h5>\n    <p>Do you work in
  Philadelphia’s healthcare industry? Are you a socialist\, or just someo
 ne who thinks the system isn’t working for us and our patients? Join us 
 November 13th starting at 7 PM at MOTW Coffee and Pastries\, for an open-e
 nded discussion on the relationship between our politics and our work. We 
 will review recent nurses' contract battles before a discussion on perspec
 tives for healthcare fights going forward with the Medicaid cuts hanging o
 ver our heads. What is necessary for us to fight back and demand more\, an
 d how do we get there?</p><p>This event is organized by the Labor Committe
 e of the Philadelphia Democratic Socialists of America\, but any curious h
 ealthcare professionals are welcome to attend!</p>\nSource: Philly DSA\nht
 tps://www.phillydsa.org/events
LOCATION:MOTW Coffee and Pastries\, 2101 Market St\, Philadelphia\, PA 191
 03
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
