DESCRIPTION:<h5><strong>More Info and RSVP:</strong></h5>\n    <p><a href=
 "https://actionnetwork.org/events/philly-dsa-stem-workers-meeting-2">https
 ://actionnetwork.org/events/philly-dsa-stem-workers-meeting-2</a></p>\n   
  \n    <h5><strong>Description:</strong></h5>\n    <p>Do you work in Phila
 delphia’s STEM industry? Are you a socialist\, or just someone who think
 s the system isn’t working for us? Join us November 15th starting at 2 P
 M at the Haraz Coffee House\, for an open-ended discussion on the relation
 ship between our politics and our work. We will review the political lands
 cape\, the threats on federal grants\, and the possibilities to organize. 
 What is necessary for us to fight back and demand more\, and how do we get
  there?</p><p>This event is organized by the Labor Committee of the Philad
 elphia Democratic Socialists of America\, but any curious STEM workers are
  welcome to attend!</p>\nSource: Philly DSA\nhttps://www.phillydsa.org/eve
 nts
LOCATION:Haraz Coffee House\, 3421 Chestnut St\, Philadelphia\, PA 19104
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.phillydsa.org/events
END:VEVENT
